7k_p7uj4WcQ7kNvwHQndLv&_nc_oc=AdqLbF1IQQI64KXQ8yMk_HnNWGqLbJ5bLmcG_lQU-tYSAT_FXu-CP9zyAfOLPCOFS74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2gqSIJJ1SkZNIieHPrL1E6YUqViOUz0tOTPEmXIzgM1w&oe=69E77890"}, {"file_name": "screens.png", "id": "771101150621784", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569471_771101160621783_7591652676362700724_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fPSxGx3es3wQ7kNvwELx72m&_nc_oc=AdpBn6LbUmfZy2_FxY9PG35YosF57JzThgBTyN5qShY3rIlnpNs6I6L-cGXHPBMJxC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3wQ-mM097Cpggj9ihxMxCxyDnsa4HqU7A-1NK-5QcL3w&oe=69E761E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Outcasts of Dungeon Magic World Rogue Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Being in the role of a brave wanderer, help dwarfs to defend their kingdom fortress from a rampaging mob of beastly invaders. Captured dwarfs need help, and they have something to offer you as a reward.\nBattle enemies through a story-based campaign across dungeon and evolve your combat skills to achieve better results.\nFeatures:\n- Procedurally generated dungeons \u2013 Twisting passages, long halls and wide-open chambers all need a hero to clear them.\n- Story-based Campaign \u2013 Fend off monsters across acts to discover the mysterious power behind their relentless assaults.\n- Companion System - Free and protect allies from captivity and use their combat power to your advantage.\n- 9 Different Enemies \u2013 Including scavengers, ghouls and a whole bunch of ugly orcs.", "short_description": "It is a third person fantasy action game, where in the role of a brave wanderer, help dwarfs to defend their kingdom fortress from a rampaging mob of beastly invaders."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midnight.works/vr/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://midnight.works/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Midnight G